OL,3,GNEWSAMan drove car at crowd, murder
OL,4,Atrial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man "deliberately" drove a car into a
OL,7,Fcrowd of people after a row outside a
OL,8,Fbar in Nottinghamshire, a trial has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FTyler Fairman, 26, died on 12 May,
OL,12,Fthree days after he was one of several
OL,13,Fpeople hit by a vehicle on Gedling Road
OL,14,Fin Arnold.
OL,16,FOn Tuesday a jury at Nottingham Crown
OL,17,FCourt was told Duane Anthony, 40 and of
OL,18,FMarton Road in Bulwell, Nottingham,
OL,19,Fdenies one count of murder and five
OL,20,Fcounts of attempted murder.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
